    # game/scripts/paths/adversary/adversary_2/adversary_2_start.rpy:146
    old "{i}• (Explore) We haven't talked enough about how different this place is. I wouldn't even call these woods. It's like her influence has poured out into the world.{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/paths/adversary/adversary_2/adversary_2_start.rpy:146
    old "{i}• (Explore) What if I don't agree with the plan? What if I'd rather do something else?{/i}"
